{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-8","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：棱锥与比例","englishTitle":"Similar pyramids which have triangular bases are in the triplicate ratio of their corresponding sides.","book":12,"number":8,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":8,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","contentId":"euclid-12-8","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0884bb3564209b0740a7fc941a90e37304b3a4494104c2cc43ceb500e5b85d1","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-8.statement","euclid-12-8.construction.1","euclid-12-8.construction.2","euclid-12-8.proof.1","euclid-12-8.proof.2","euclid-12-8.proof.3","euclid-12-8.proof.4","euclid-12-8.proof.5","euclid-12-8.proof.6","euclid-12-8.proof.7","euclid-12-8.proof.8","euclid-12-8.proof.9","euclid-12-8.proof.10","euclid-12-8.proof.11","euclid-12-8.proof.12","euclid-12-8.proof.13","euclid-12-8.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-8.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de9ab8b328888d6554b305e4db72753cbe34b05ec7e697d444e6934f9ee29e18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similar pyramids which have triangular bases are in the triplicate ratio of their corresponding sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"具有三角底边的类似金字塔在相应的立方比面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e39de5a08501e22fe4a51af6d52d7411eb8d778ac32e53b96edb2cfd9492a23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be similar and similarly situated pyramids of which the triangles ABC, DEF, are the bases and the points G, H the vertices; I say that the pyramid ABCG has to the pyramid DEFH the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"类似和类似的金字塔,其中三角形ABC,DEF是底边,点G,H是顶峰;我说金字塔ABCG与金字塔DEFH的比例是BC比EF的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e89e2414fc27d2ac23277c635521eb4eaad7d43c0d59282fda302f3e4afa1d9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the parallelepipedal solids BGML, EHQP be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"完成平行管道固体BGML,EHQP"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a89131e8f7628462c7910dc1c063c0070c142dfa88c46c3d9e04d0b6509120d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the pyramid ABCG is similar to the pyramid DEFH, therefore the angle ABC is equal to the angle DEF, the angle GBC to the angle HEF, and the angle ABG to the angle DEH; and, as AB is to DE, so is BC to EF, and BG to EH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于金字塔ABCG与金字塔DEFH相似,因此,ABC角等于角度DEF,GBC角等于角度HEF,ABG角等于角度DEH;AB比DE等于BC比EF,BG比EH；AB 与 DE 之比等于 BC 与 EF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e2c6c6b736c3210a46c358d6df074fb52869a3a8580df1fc4b11aed1f49098a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as AB is to DE, so is BC to EF, and the sides are proportional about equal angles, therefore the parallelogram BM is similar to the parallelogram EQ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB比DE等于BC比EF,两边是成比例,因此平行四边形比BM与平行四边形比EQ相似；AB 与 DE 之比等于 BC 与 EF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"361c1bdef80d13215c345d5b3314f2060b66c109ebf099908e18c89003ef93db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason BN is also similar to ER, and BK to EO; therefore the three parallelograms MB, BK, BN are similar to the three EQ, EO, ER."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,BN件也与ER件和BK件相似,EO件与EO件相似;因此,这3 平行四边形件MB件、BK件、BN件与3件EQ件、EO件、ER件相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a56e2b3248413fed6f09932007c18a9873f86b237b79f1050f1b9c97a8d2228","citations":["euclid-11-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the three parallelograms MB, BK, BN are equal and similar to their three opposites, and the three EQ, EO, ER are equal and similar to their three opposites. [[XI. 24](/principles/euclid-11-24)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,三架平行四边形 MB,BK,BN是平等的,与三架对立物相似,三架EQ,EO,ER是平等的,与三架对立物相似。 [[XI. 24](/principles/euclid-11-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"281ced2278c05b0c33fab6c7cd457f2b1473a14e86224aa04af1324471e6d636","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the solids BGML, EHQP are contained by similar planes equal in multitude."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BGML,EHQP固体由类似平面的体积形成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3bf3f5c676e6db739e20be98b93b549209856e395dff18eaa6cd22815cbf8b2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the solid BGML is similar to the solid EHQP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BGML固体与EHQP固体类似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94cc0f308119393387a5ab46f4bd9fab0dc931f0e0497be4fd99295ab07691ed","citations":["euclid-11-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But similar parallelepipedal solids are in the triplicate ratio of their corresponding sides. [[XI. 33](/principles/euclid-11-33)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但类似的平行管道固体 也存在于它们相应的立方比面 [[XI. 33](/principles/euclid-11-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ff8e24bd8621668eb47f642b198c0d8645b5461312e3b59b5b2e9dd88e77297","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the solid BGML has to the solid EHQP the ratio triplicate of that which the corresponding side BC has to the corresponding side EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BGML固体与EHQP固体的比例是BC的三倍,而BC固体与EF的相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e7faa8bacd0489d1470f7886ef6d5949441a690b479f0c69e4aaa1fbe7e3eb80","citations":["euclid-11-28","euclid-12-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the solid BGML is to the solid EHQP, so is the pyramid ABCG to the pyramid DEFH, inasmuch as the pyramid is a sixth part of the solid, because the prism which is half of the parallelepipedal solid [[XI. 28](/principles/euclid-11-28)] is also triple of the pyramid. [[XII. 7](/principles/euclid-12-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,BGML和EHQP的固体比例等于ABCG和DEFH金字塔的比例,因为金字塔是固体的第六部分,因为平行管道固体的一半棱镜也是金字塔的三倍。 [[XI. 28](/principles/euclid-11-28)] [[XII. 7](/principles/euclid-12-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fde7c6a5ea7ca5f7b575e67bef8471f8a83791df87ca7a495b8462b5c1149178","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the pyramid ABCG also has to the pyramid DEFH the ratio triplicate of that which BC has to EF. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,金字塔ABCG与金字塔DEFH的比例是BC比EF比Q比E比D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"36be3a36af0e006bd78b5deb6c8110c9be6a015111dba6e7fc3bfdfd6ba7b9f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that similar pyramids which have polygonal bases are also to one another in the triplicate ratio of their corresponding sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"推论,从这一点可以看出,具有多边形底边的类似金字塔在相应的立方比面之间也是相互的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dd82cb8a3b2c936eb681313aa56d05da473ca4559d683be2b5d514896f221e3","citations":["euclid-6-20","euclid-5-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if they are divided into the pyramids contained in them which have triangular bases, by virtue of the fact that the similar polygons forming their bases are also divided into similar triangles equal in multitude and corresponding to the wholes [[VI. 20](/principles/euclid-6-20)], then, as the one pyramid which has a triangular base in the one complete pyramid is to the one pyramid which has a triangular base in the other complete pyramid, so also will all the pyramids which have triangular bases contained in the one pyramid be to all the pyramids which have triangular bases contained in the other pyramid [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)], that is, the pyramid itself which has a polygonal base to the pyramid which has a polygonal base."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为如果它们被分为包含三角形底边的金字塔, 其构成为底边的类似多边形个三角形, 数量相同, 与整个的三角形相对应, 那么,由于一个金字塔的三角形底边是一个完整的金字塔, 是一个金字塔的三角型底边, 另一完整的金字塔, 其构成为三角形底边, 同一金字塔的金字塔也都是所有包含在另一个金字塔里的三角底边的金字塔, 也就是金字塔本身。其多角底边到金字塔 其多边角底边。 [[VI. 20](/principles/euclid-6-20)] [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ff9f60805c62e3cb0eec5a2b59b84ab64d8359df3287ee7954949432e62eecb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the pyramid which has a triangular base is to the pyramid which has a triangular base in the triplicate ratio of the corresponding sides; therefore also the pyramid which has a polygonal base has to the pyramid which has a similar base the ratio triplicate of that which the side has to the side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,三角形底边的金字塔是金字塔,在对应的立方比面有三角形底边;因此,具有多边形底边的金字塔也与金字塔具有类似底边的三重比,而侧面则具有三重比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-8.source","contentId":"euclid-12-8","revisionId":"euclid-12-8@raw-a0884bb3564209b0","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed751d7f5247b5b940285bad1a8fdc41a0cb094be95f22a29771af6b7029a3fb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-8:euclid-11-24:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-8.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-24","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"XI. 24"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-8:euclid-11-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-8.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-33","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"XI. 33"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-8:euclid-11-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-8.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"XI. 28"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-8:euclid-12-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-8.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"XII. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-8:euclid-6-20:explicit","s